---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Legacy Major-Country Timetable Retired | Where Horses Run"
  description="The former static major-country timetable has been retired. Use the reviewed Calendar, Today, Tomorrow, Current Timetable, country, and racecourse pages instead."
  canonicalPath="/major-countries/timetable/"
>
  <nav class="legacy-timetable__nav" aria-label="Current timetable navigation">
    <a href="/calendar/">Calendar</a>
    <a href="/today/">Today</a>
    <a href="/tomorrow/">Tomorrow</a>
    <a href="/major-countries/current-timetable/">Current timetable</a>
    <a href="/countries/">Countries</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Legacy timetable retired</p>
    <h1 id="page-title">Major-Country Timetable</h1>
    <p class="hero__summary">
      The former static/manual timetable v0 is no longer rendered as a public timetable. Use the reviewed public Calendar and meeting pages for current coverage.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-grid" aria-label="Current public timetable routes">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Calendar</h2>
      <p>Browse reviewed meetings by date without expanding complete programme details on the list page.</p>
      <p><a href="/calendar/">Open Calendar</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Today and Tomorrow</h2>
      <p>Use the date-specific public views for the current reviewed meeting window.</p>
      <p><a href="/today/">Open Today</a> · <a href="/tomorrow/">Open Tomorrow</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Current timetable</h2>
      <p>Open the reviewed current timetable and follow a meeting-detail link when additional public-safe timing fields are available.</p>
      <p><a href="/major-countries/current-timetable/">Open Current Timetable</a></p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="card legacy-timetable__boundary" aria-labelledby="boundary-title">
    <h2 id="boundary-title">Publication boundary</h2>
    <p>
      Public list pages keep one meeting per row. Race-by-race programme summary fields appear only on a reviewed meeting-detail page when the applicable publication rank permits them.
    </p>
    <p>Complete official information should be confirmed at the linked official source.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legacy-timetable__nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--whr-space-3);
    margin-block-end: var(--whr-space-4);
  }

  .legacy-timetable__nav a {
    min-width: 2.75rem;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .legacy-timetable__boundary {
    margin-block-start: var(--whr-space-4);
  }

  .legacy-timetable__boundary h2,
  .legacy-timetable__boundary p {
    margin-block: 0;
  }

  .legacy-timetable__boundary p + p {
    margin-block-start: var(--whr-space-2);
  }
</style>
